.md
## Notebook Storage
A persistent storage for arbitrary expressions inside a notebook.

:::feature
The data is preserved even if the notebook is exported to an HTML file and reimported back.
:::

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Notebook Storage
A persistent storage for arbitrary expressions inside a notebook.

:::feature
The data is preserved even if the notebook is exported to an HTML file and reimported back.
:::

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: false
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
NotebookWrite[NotebookStore["date"], Now]
NotebookRead[NotebookStore["date"]]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*VB[*)(DateObject[{2026,10,23,15,15,39.240017`8.346304165380461},"Instant","Gregorian",2.`])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNiYGAo5gUSYZmp5S6pyflFiSX5RcEsQBGXxJLUYCkgQ8mtKFPByFjBP7lEwcjAyEzB0NQKiIwtlQAgXA+T"*)(*]VB*)

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
It stores any expressions as compressed WL code

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
It stores any expressions as compressed WL code

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
In a case of the context loss, please, provide `Notebook` explicitly and use async version - `NotebookReadAsync`

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
In a case of the context loss, please, provide `Notebook` explicitly and use async version - `NotebookReadAsync`

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
nb = EvaluationNotebook[];
Button["Get", Then[NotebookReadAsync[NotebookStore[nb, "date"]], Print]]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Or use async-await:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Or use async-await:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
NotebookWrite[NotebookStore["key"], 123];

With[{n = EvaluationNotebook[]},
	(* evaluation context is ok *)
	EventHandler[InputButton[], AsyncFunction[Null, Module[{data},
		(* evaluation context is lost!!! *)
		
		data = NotebookReadAsync[NotebookStore[n, "key"]] // Await;
        NotebookWrite[NotebookStore[n, "key"], data+1];
	]]]
]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Click a few times and read it

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Click a few times and read it

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
NotebookRead[NotebookStore["key"]]

